                                                "example_id": "0a81a2f5-acc6-42a8-a97e-938d11ed992b",
                                                "sense_id": "d49fa4df-adf8-31ad-8756-21c773e1a9aa",
                                                "text": "Seferian states in the order that he agrees with Carter and the other charging parties that \"the actions taken by Sister Levy have had and will continue to have the adverse effects on the union complained of by the charging parties.\" But Seferian found that Levy committed no chargeable offense since freedom of speech is guaranteed in AFSCME's International Constitution."
